{#
  Station0 renders `text` blocks itself (Markdown, page-local images,
  thumbnails), so this template is not used — the folder and schema.yaml
  are what the admin needs. It shows the pattern for your own rich-text
  blocks: a textarea printed with the `markdown` filter (station0 >= 0.10.3).
#}
<div class="block block--text">{{ (block.body ?? '')|markdown }}</div>
